<title>USA: Savannah Bancorp raises qtly div to $0.04.</title>
<headline>Savannah Bancorp raises qtly div to $0.04.</headline>
<dateline>SAVANNAH, Ga. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Savannah Bancorp Inc on Monday said its directors increased the company's regular quarterly cash dividend to four cents per share from a split-adjusted two cents per share.</p>
<p>The record date for the cash dividend is May 2, the company said in a statement, and the dividends are payable on May 19.</p>
<p>Savannah Bancorp is the holding company for the Savannah Bank.</p>
